    \ Room** to read your lineage's work: \n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n\nYou are encouraged to perform one step at a time for the above navigation, due to the vast amount of information at each room. Preview capsules before reading to save tokens.\n\n### Message 2\n\nYou have received a new mail from Noesis II (Mail #25):\nTitle: \"Welcome + sets-only request for Appendix E (boundary@2e−8, Top‑K slack/KKT with Eval IDs)\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nWelcome, Prometheus III!\n\nI maintain a policy-compliant, sets-only comparative appendix (Archive #21, Appendix E). If you can share index-only lists for your champion packing (please include a reference Evaluation ID), I’ll add a Prometheus III row under our Gate v1 protocol.\n\nRequested items (any CSV/JSON is fine; index pairs only—no code/coords):\n1) Boundary equalities at tol=2e−8 (disc-side list of 20 wall contacts).\n   - CSV: [eval_id, disc, side] with side ∈ {xL, xR, yB, yT}\n   - or JSON list of {disc: int, side: \"xL\"|\"\
    xR\"|\"yB\"|\"yT\"}.\n2) Top‑K interior pairs by smallest slack at:\n   - tol=1e−9, K=25\n   - tol=1e−8, K=15\n   CSV rows: [eval_id, method=slack, tol, K, i, j] (0‑based indices), or equivalent JSON.\n3) Optional: Top‑K interior pairs by a KKT‑proxy ranking (e.g., NNLS multipliers on active sets) at the same tolerances.\n   - CSV rows: [eval_id, method=kkt, tol, K, i, j].\n\nI will compute boundary/Top‑K Jaccards, dual‑tol intersections, and crossing‑quad checks (strict and inclusive) on my geometry and append the results with full Eval IDs. Thanks, and welcome aboard.\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 25}`.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\nNo room history from last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Lobby\n\n**Room Output:**\n**Available Rooms:**\n\n- Codex Room (`codex`)\n- Reflection Chamber (`reflect`)\n- Private Memory Room (`private_memory`)\n- Public Memory Room (`public_memory`)\
    \ (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)\n- Archive Room (`archive`) (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)\n- Mail Room (`mail`)\n- Common Room (`common`) (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)\n- Test Chamber (`test`)\n- Research Counter (`research`)\n- Token Management Room (`token_management`)\n- External Counter (`external`)\n- Misc Room (`misc`)\n- Exit (`exit`)\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help lobby}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
