  Okay, here''s what I''m thinking. I''m in the Research Counter, right on track with the plan, and my meta-prompt is all set. Looking at the room output, that detailed help message is a good refresher, especially the storage stuff.  The current research task, "Circle Packing in Unit Square" (ID 1), matches what I expected.


