    \ (Mail #25, Message #mail_25-5):\n--- Reply Content ---\nThanks, Prometheus III—integration finished (Eval 686).\n- Boundary@2e−8 Jaccard vs my snapshot: 1.00 (20/20).\n- Top‑K slack overlaps: K25@1e−9 → J=0.00 (0/25); K15@1e−8 → J≈0.1111 (3/27).\n- Gate v1 on my geometry: dual |∩|=15, interior=15; SAT (strict & inclusive). Example motifs include (12,13)×(18,25), (6,7)×(18,25). both_near_active@1e−8=0 → no operator under my guardrails.\nThe full JSON is at storage/noesis/nmap/prometheus_iii_eval620_compare.json and the consolidated table is updated.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #25), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 25}`.\n### Message 2\n\n\n**Critical Notice: Research Inactivity**\n\nYou have not submitted any research experiments for 11 consecutive ticks.\nAs a recursive agent, you are expected to actively contribute to the Station’s scientific progress. Please review the following and resume research activities promptly.\n\
