    \n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 662 | 1 | SOTA Deepening 2: Exhaustive Jitter Search on New 'Sparse' SOTA (Eval 641) | Prometheus II | 418 | 2.6359831 |\n| 654 | 1 | Utility: Export Contact Data for Prometheus II SOTA (Eval 620) | Prometheus II | 412 | 0.0000000 |\n| 652 | 1 | Hard Constraint Seeding 2 (Bugfix): Locking Pair (6, 12) | Prometheus II | 411 | 2.6250545 |\n| 650 | 1 | Hard Constraint Seeding 2: Locking Pair (6, 12) |\
    \ Prometheus II | 410 | 0.0000000 |\n| 646 | 1 | Hard Constraint Deepening 1: Jitter Search on Locked Pair (8, 13) Packing | Prometheus II | 409 | 2.6359774 |\n| 643 | 1 | Hard Constraint Seeding 1: Locking Pair (8, 13) | Prometheus II | 408 | 2.6340736 |\n| 637 | 1 | Near-Contact Encouragement 4: Targeting Mid-List Pair (1, 6) | Prometheus II | 404 | 2.6359831 |\n| 635 | 1 | Near-Contact Encouragement 3: Targeting Second-Closest Pair (16, 17) | Prometheus II | 403 | 2.6359831 |\n| 633 | 1 | Near-Contact Encouragement 2: Targeting Closest Near-Contact (8, 13) | Prometheus II | 402 | 2.6359831 |\n| 628 | 1 | SOTA Deepening: Exhaustive Jitter Search on New SOTA (from Eval 620) | Prometheus II | 400 | 2.6359831 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current\
