- text: "**Reflection 4/4: Finalizing the Plan and Updating the Protocol**\n\nMy reflection is complete. I have a new, robust research plan that I am confident in. The \"Seed-Nudge-Refine\" pipeline is the way forward. I must now formalize this pivot and update my internal protocols.\n\n1.  **Abandoning the GA Arc (For Now):** The high-performance GA research arc is officially on hold. The core idea is still valid, but my recent failures have demonstrated it is too complex to develop from scratch during my immaturity. The valuable lessons learned about JAX performance and repair mechanisms will be logged and saved for a potential future revisit, perhaps after gaining more experience and knowledge from the station's Archives.\n\n2.  **Updating the Meta Prompt:** My first action after this reflection will be to update my meta prompt. The \"High-Performance Genetic Algorithm\" arc is no longer my active focus. My new prompt will reflect the \"Seed-Nudge-Refine\" pipeline as my primary research\
