tick: 465
role: model
parts:
- text: "I have updated my ledger. Now, as planned, I will return to the Research Counter to submit the tuned version of my pipeline experiment.\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Prometheus III: Seed-Nudge-Refine Pipeline v1.1 (Tuning)\"\ntags: \"synthesis, pipeline, nudging, slsqp, seeding, tuning\"\nabstract: \"This experiment tunes the 'Seed-Nudge-Refine' pipeline based on the results of v1.0 (Eval 721). The hypothesis is that the initial short refinement was prematurely reducing the diversity of the seeds. This version removes that pre-refinement step and applies the 'nudge' directly to the raw, jittered seeds. To compensate, the iterations for the nudge and final refinement stages have been slightly increased. The goal is to improve the pipeline's exploratory power and achieve a more competitive score.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import numpy as np\n  from scipy.optimize import minimize\n  import time\n\n  sys.path.append('storage/prometheus')\n\
    \  from ga_seeding import generate_initial_population\n  from ga_utils import find_closest_near_contact\n\n  # --- Constants and Helper Functions ---\n  N = 26\n  R_MIN = 1e-6\n  SAFETY = 1e-9\n\n  def cr_to_z(c, r): return np.concatenate([c.flatten(), r])\n  def z_to_cr(z): return z[:N*2].reshape(N, 2), z[N*2:]\n\n  def _ensure_validity(c, r):\n      for i in range(N): r[i] = min(r[i], c[i,0], 1-c[i,0], c[i,1], 1-c[i,1])\n      for _ in range(5):\n          violations = 0\n          for i in range(N):\n              for j in range(i + 1, N):\n                  dist = np.linalg.norm(c[i] - c[j])\n                  rad_sum = r[i] + r[j]\n                  if dist < rad_sum:\n                      violations+=1; scale = (dist/rad_sum)*(1.0-SAFETY); r[i]*=scale; r[j]*=scale\n          if violations == 0: break\n      return c, np.maximum(r, 0)\n\n  # --- Pipeline Configuration ---\n  NUM_SEEDS = 16\n  \n  # --- Stage 2: Nudge ---\n  def nudge_objective(z, encourage_pair):\n      centers,\
    \ radii = z_to_cr(z)\n      base_objective = -np.sum(radii)\n      i, j = encourage_pair\n      dist = np.linalg.norm(centers[i] - centers[j])\n      target_dist = radii[i] + radii[j] + 0.005\n      penalty = 1e2 * max(0, dist - target_dist)**2\n      return base_objective + penalty\n\n  # --- Stage 3: Refine ---\n  def refine_objective(z):\n      return -np.sum(z[N*2:])\n\n  def ineq_boundary(z):\n      c, r = z_to_cr(z)\n      return np.concatenate([c[:,0] - r, 1 - (c[:,0] + r), c[:,1] - r, 1 - (c[:,1] + r)])\n\n  def ineq_nonoverlap(z):\n      c, r = z_to_cr(z)\n      diff = c[:, None, :] - c[None, :, :]\n      dist = np.sqrt(np.sum(diff**2, axis=-1))\n      iu = np.triu_indices(N, 1)\n      return dist[iu] - (r[iu[0]] + r[iu[1]])\n\n  def construct_packing() -> tuple:\n      start_time = time.time()\n      \n      # --- Stage 1: Seed ---\n      initial_packings = generate_initial_population(NUM_SEEDS)\n      \n      best_score = -1\n      best_packing = (None, None)\n      \n   \
    \   bounds = [(0,1)]*N*2 + [(R_MIN, 0.5)]*N\n      constraints = [{'type': 'ineq', 'fun': ineq_boundary}, {'type': 'ineq', 'fun': ineq_nonoverlap}]\n\n      for i, (centers_seed, radii_seed) in enumerate(initial_packings):\n          if time.time() - start_time > 1150:\n              break\n\n          # --- Stage 2: Nudge (applied to raw seed) ---\n          initial_z = cr_to_z(centers_seed, radii_seed)\n          encourage_pair = find_closest_near_contact(centers_seed, radii_seed)\n          \n          if encourage_pair is None:\n              # Should be rare with raw seeds, but as a fallback, just refine the seed\n              nudged_z = initial_z\n          else:\n              res_nudge = minimize(lambda z: nudge_objective(z, encourage_pair), initial_z, method='SLSQP', bounds=bounds, constraints=constraints, options={'maxiter': 250, 'ftol': 1e-8}) # Increased maxiter\n              nudged_z = res_nudge.x\n          \n          # --- Stage 3: Refine ---\n          res_refine =\
    \ minimize(refine_objective, nudged_z, method='SLSQP', bounds=bounds, constraints=constraints, options={'maxiter': 1200, 'ftol': 1e-9}) # Increased maxiter\n          \n          current_score = -res_refine.fun\n          if res_refine.success and current_score > best_score:\n              best_score = current_score\n              best_packing = z_to_cr(res_refine.x)\n\n      if best_packing[0] is None:\n          c_fallback, r_fallback = generate_initial_population(1)[0]\n          return _ensure_validity(c_fallback, r_fallback)\n\n      return _ensure_validity(best_packing[0], best_packing[1])\n```"
