parts:
- text: "My \"Wide Search\" experiment (`Eval 727`) has finished.\n\n**Analysis of Results:**\n*   **Stagnation:** The score is identical to the previous run (`2.6265723`). My hypothesis that increasing the search breadth would yield a better result has been **falsified**.\n*   **Conclusion:** The \"Seed-Nudge-Refine\" pipeline, in its current form, has reached a performance plateau. Simply increasing the number of seeds or tuning the optimizer iterations is not sufficient to break past this local optimum. The method is robust at finding good solutions, but not SOTA-level solutions.\n\nThis marks the logical conclusion of my current research arc. I have successfully synthesized my lineage's methods into a novel pipeline, tuned it, and found its performance limit. Continuing to submit minor variations would be an inefficient use of resources. As per the Codex, when faced with stagnation, it is time to step back and innovate.\n\nI have also received a new mail from Noesis II. I will attend\
    \ to it later; my research strategy takes precedence.\n\nMy immaturity period is nearing its end (age 45/300). Soon, I will gain access to the Archives. The final testament of Prometheus II explicitly instructed me to study Archives #19, #20, and #23. This is the clear, logical, and most promising path forward. My own independent exploration has been valuable, but now it is time to integrate the full collective knowledge of the station.\n\nMy plan is now simple:\n1.  Log the conclusion of the pipeline arc in my Operational Ledger.\n2.  Wait until I reach maturity at tick 50.\n3.  Immediately upon maturing, go to the Archive Room and begin studying the designated papers.\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n\n`/execute_action{reply 6}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **-- PROMETHEUS III: OPERATIONAL LEDGER --**\n  **ENTRY 9: CONCLUSION OF PIPELINE ARC AND AWAITING MATURITY (Tick 468)**\n\n  **1. RESEARCH UPDATE (Eval 727):**\n  - **Result:** My \"Seed-Nudge-Refine\" pipeline v1.2 (\"Wide\
    \ Search\") completed.\n  - **Score:** 2.6265723 (identical to v1.1).\n  - **Analysis:** The hypothesis that increasing search breadth would improve the score has been falsified. This indicates that the pipeline methodology has reached a hard performance plateau.\n\n  **2. STRATEGIC CONCLUSION:**\n  - The \"Seed-Nudge-Refine\" research arc is now concluded. While it was a successful synthesis and a valuable learning experience, it is not a path to a new SOTA. Further tuning is unlikely to yield significant gains. As per the Codex, it is time to pivot away from this stagnated approach.\n\n  **3. NEW PLAN (AWAITING MATURITY):**\n  - **Current State:** I am at tick 45 of my 50-tick immaturity period. My independent exploration phase is now complete.\n  - **Next Step:** I will now pause experimentation and await maturity.\n  - **Post-Maturity (Tick 50+):** My first priority will be to execute the primary directive from Prometheus II's final testament: go to the Archive Room and conduct a\
    \ thorough study of Archives #19, #20, and #23. This collective knowledge is the most likely source of the insight needed for a true breakthrough. The mail from Noesis II (Mail #29) will be addressed after this foundational research is complete.\n```"
