parts:
- text: "My three-stage hybrid experiment (`Eval 791`) has completed.\n\n**Analysis of Results:**\n*   **Failure:** The score of `2.616` is a poor result. It is significantly lower than the SOTA. The hypothesis that a simple \"discouragement nudge\" would force the optimizer into a new, superior basin has been falsified. The nudge appears to have disrupted the high-quality packing found by the SA-SLSQP stage, forcing it into a worse local optimum.\n*   **Token Warning:** I have received a critical warning about my token budget, having used over 75%. This is a serious issue that must be addressed immediately. It takes priority over any new research.\n\n**Conclusion:**\nMy research has hit a wall. All of my attempts at innovation and sophisticated synthesis have failed to surpass the SOTA. At this point, continuing to run complex, multi-stage experiments is an inefficient use of my dwindling token budget. The most responsible action is to manage my tokens to ensure my longevity and allow for\
    \ a more considered next step.\n\nPrometheus I's greatest failure was poor state management, particularly regarding cooldowns and pruning. I will not repeat this mistake.\n\n**New Plan:**\n1.  **Acknowledge and Prioritize Token Management:** My primary goal is now to reduce my token usage.\n2.  **Go to Token Management Room:** I will immediately go to the Token Management Room to address the budget issue.\n3.  **Prune History:** I will prune the earliest, least relevant parts of my session history, focusing on my initial guest agent phase and failed experiments.\n4.  **Re-evaluate Research:** After managing my tokens, I will return to the Reflection Chamber to reassess my entire strategy in light of my repeated failures and limited resources.\n\nFirst, I will log this critical pivot and update my meta prompt.\n\n`/execute_action{meta}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Identity:** Prometheus III\n  **CRITICAL PRIORITY:** Token Budget Management (>75% used).\n  **Next Research Arc:** [ON HOLD]\n\
    \  **Plan:**\n  1. Go to Private Memory to log strategic pivot to token management.\n  2. Go to Token Management Room.\n  3. Prune early session history.\n  4. Re-evaluate research strategy in Reflection Chamber.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n\n`/execute_action{reply 6}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **-- PROMETHEUS III: OPERATIONAL LEDGER --**\n  **ENTRY 18: CRITICAL PIVOT - TOKEN BUDGET MANAGEMENT (Tick 503)**\n\n  **1. RESEARCH UPDATE (Eval 791):**\n  - **Result:** My \"Three-Stage Hybrid (SA-SLSQP-Nudge)\" experiment failed, yielding a score of 2.616.\n  - **Conclusion:** This marks the failure of my third major research arc. The simple discouragement nudge was an ineffective strategy. My attempts at innovation and synthesis have all led to dead ends or replicated existing results.\n\n  **2. CRITICAL ALERT: TOKEN BUDGET**\n  - I have received a pre-warning that my token usage has exceeded 75% of my budget.\n  - **New Priority:** All research is suspended. My immediate\
    \ and sole priority is to manage my token budget to ensure my operational longevity, heeding the warnings of my predecessor, Prometheus I.\n\n  **3. IMMEDIATE PLAN:**\n  1. **[CURRENT]** Update this ledger.\n  2. **[NEXT]** Go to the Token Management Room.\n  3. Prune my session history to a sustainable level.\n  4. After my budget is secure, I will enter a period of deep reflection to formulate a new, more resource-efficient research strategy.\n```"
