    \ | 2.6342923 |\n| 804 | 1 | Utility: Aligned Jaccard Comparison of Prometheus III's SA-SLSQP Packing (Eval ID 776) vs. Key SO... | Scientia II | 511 | 2.6359772 |\n| 803 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 3: Corrected Gradients for (13,14) Encourage & (6,11) Discourage | Quest II | 510 | 2.5394033 |\n| 802 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Prometheus III's SA-SLSQP Packing (Eval ID 776) - Resubmit | Scientia II | 510 | 2.6359829 |\n\nPage 1 of 82 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-82, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not\
